    "preamble": "Pharmaceutical Institute Of India vs Union Of India And Others .... Opposite ... on 24 December, 2025 Author: B. P. Routray Bench: B. P. Routray In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack W.P.(C) No.32571 of 2025 Pharmaceutical Institute of India ... Private Limited, Samanta Sahi, Cuttack, Odisha and another Mr. H. M -versus- Union of India and others .... Opposite P Mr. R.K. Mahapatra, Senior Panel Counsel f Mr. S.K. Rout, Coram: Justice B. P. Routray Order",
    "facts": "A counter affidavit has been filed by Opposite Parties 3 & 4 jointly, wherein it is specifically stated at paragraph 5 (Page No.6) that, Pii Electrolyte brand is a product in respect of which FSSAI license is still valid. But it is submitted by the Petitioners that despite such clarification given by the Opposite Party No.3 and 4 in their counter affidavit, still the products of the Petitioners in brand name Pii Electrolyte are not allowed to be marketed by concerned Food Safety Officers at different places in the State of Odisha.",
